{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Combined rehearsal correction shared with 561e: a post-rewrite verifier run against a clone that retained both old and rewritten refs is not publication-faithful and corrupts position-anchor selection; a synthetic writer against the old remote resurrected old-tip ancestry via merge . Those results are rejected. A clean disposable bare remote now exposes only rewritten tip  as ; its default clone has 65,769 commits, 4,469 merges, old tip absent, and size-pack 152,488 KiB. Identity equality and a correctly configured post-publication writer test must pass there before maintenance readiness."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785888690168084001,"uuid":"2eede2d0-e66a-476b-80bc-1f9c5966ae33"}